    skos:definition "Name of the County of the NHSN facility that this data record applies to. Use [[cvdFacilityId]] to identify the facility. To provide other details, [[healthcareReportingData]] can be used on a [[Hospital]] entry." .

:cvdFacilityId a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
